&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:start&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:medium&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;Asgari &amp;uuml;cret bu şartlarda&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;en az y&amp;uuml;zde elli artırılmalıdır&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Y&amp;uuml;zde 20 zam, Y&amp;uuml;zde 30 zam, bu yangını s&amp;ouml;nd&amp;uuml;rmez. Saadet Partisi olarak s&amp;ouml;yl&amp;uuml;yoruz: İnsanca yaşam haktır. Adil paylaşım şarttır.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

